// Title: Windows LAPS Credential Dump From Entra ID
// ID: a4b25073-8947-489c-a8dd-93b41c23f26d
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: andrewdanis
// Date: 2024-06-26
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1098.005
// Description: Detects when an account dumps the LAPS password from Entra ID.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

from siem.events where (category == "Device" AND contains(activityType, "Recover device local administrator password") AND contains(additionalDetails.additionalInfo, "Successfully recovered local credential by device id"))
